<p dir="auto" data-start="118" data-end="594">Nova pretraga vrijedi za svih 5 javnih dijagrama i radi po svim postojećim kriterijima: <strong data-start="206" data-end="247">šifra, ime osobe, ime oca i ime majke</strong>. Pri pretrazi zanemaruje velika/mala slova, <code data-start="292" data-end="299">č/ć/c</code>, <code data-start="301" data-end="306">š/s</code>, <code data-start="308" data-end="313">ž/z</code>, <code data-start="315" data-end="323">đ/d/dj</code>, prihvaća <code data-start="334" data-end="342">ije/je</code>, uobičajene padežne oblike te godinu zajedno s imenom. Provjerio sam je na javnim dijagramima s upitima poput <strong data-start="453" data-end="471">„Juru Tandaru”</strong>, <strong data-start="473" data-end="489">„Bozu Cosic”</strong>, <strong data-start="491" data-end="515">„Simuna Grgina 1800”</strong>, <strong data-start="517" data-end="540">„Ivicu Mijina 1975”</strong>, <strong data-start="542" data-end="562">„Cvitana Matina”</strong> i <strong data-start="565" data-end="593">„Kresimira Matkova 1953”</strong>.</p>
